  "apparatus": "# Transcription — The Example Gazette, Vol. IV, No. 1, May 1, 1875\n\n## Transcription apparatus (not source text)\n\nSource: `source/example-gazette-v4n1.pdf` (an invented specimen). Each page begins with a page anchor; headings of the form “PDF page N” and text in [supplied: …] are editorial, not source text.\n\n",
