      "text": "<!-- PDF_PAGE: 3 -->\n## PDF page 3 — printed page 3\n\nTHE EXAMPLE GAZETTE. 3\n\n### THE SPRING EXHIBITION\n\nThe exhibition of the Anytown Improvement Society opened on Thursday in the Town Hall, and will remain open through Saturday.\n\n[supplied: An engraving of the Town Hall, about a third of the column wide, with its caption below. canary-page-text-02]\n\n*The Town Hall, from Main Street.* A notice on the door reads [illegible].\n\nThe prize for the best garden plan went to Mrs. Jane Doe of Eastfield; the judges also commended a model of the new bridge. [unclear: Admission] ten cents.\n\n",
