      "text": "<!-- PDF_PAGE: 4 -->\n## PDF page 4 — printed page 4\n\n4 THE EXAMPLE GAZETTE.\n\n### CORRESPONDENCE\n\n*The Gazette is not responsible for the opinions of its correspondents.*\n\n#### A Word for the Old Road\n\nSir, — I have travelled the old road to Riverton for thirty years and see no need of a new one. Mend the old one, and spare us the \\*improvements\\*.\n\n[Communicated.]\n\n— A SUBSCRIBER.\n\nSir, — When are we to have lamps on Elm Street? The darkness there is a public danger. — J.Q.P.\n\n",
