      "text": "<!-- PDF_PAGE: 5 -->\n## PDF page 5 — printed page 5\n\nTHE EXAMPLE GAZETTE. 5\n\n### NOTICE OF A MEETING\n\nThe Anytown Improvement Society will meet on Thursday, May 13, at eight o’clock, at the Café Anytown, Main Street. Members and friends are invited. Particulars from the secretary, Mrs. Jane Doe, 12 Elm Street, Anytown; telephone 555-0142. canary-contact-03\n\n---\n\n### MARKET PRICES\n\n*Corrected weekly by Public & Doe.*\n\n```text\nWheat, per bushel ....... $1.10\nOats, per bushel ........  0.45\nButter, per pound .......  0.28\nEggs, per dozen .........  0.18\n```\n\n",
