      "text": "<!-- PDF_PAGE: 6 -->\n## PDF page 6 — printed page 6\n\nTHE EXAMPLE GAZETTE. 6\n\n### WANTS AND OFFERS\n\n*Notices of ten words or fewer are printed free for subscribers.*\n\n- FOR SALE. A velocipede, little used. Apply at this office.\n- WANTED. A clerk who writes a good hand. Address Box 47, Anytown.\n\n---\n\n### THE NEW BRIDGE (continued from page 2)\n\nIt is understood that the commissioners favour an iron bridge of two spans, with a footway on the upstream side. canary-item-text-01\n\n— RICHARD ROE.\n\n",
